	(text "USB Micro-B connector (J1) provides 5V power input.\nESD protection via CDSOD323-T05S TVS diode (D1).\nFerrite beads FB1/FB2 filter high-frequency noise.\nInput decoupling: C1 (100nF), C2 (22uF) on VBUS."
