	(text "TI BQ25060 single-cell Li-ion charger (U1).\nVBUS_F input from USB after ESD/ferrite filtering.\nCharge current set by R1 (ISET pin).\nNTC thermistor input (TS) for battery temp monitoring.\nCHG_STAT output: charge status indicator (active low).\nOutput: VBAT (3.0V-4.2V) to battery connector J2."
