	(text "ST STC3100 coulomb counter / fuel gauge (U3).\nMonitors battery voltage and current via sense resistor R22 (30mOhm).\nI2C interface (SDA/SCL) reports state-of-charge to MCU.\nBattery connector J2 (JST PH 2-pin).\nTest points J3-J5 for VBAT/GND access."
