	(text "TI TPS63060 buck-boost DC-DC converter (U4).\nInput: VBAT (2.5V-4.2V from battery or USB).\nOutput: V3V3 (3.3V regulated) for all digital logic.\nPWR_EN input: enables/disables output (power latch).\nInductor L2 (1.5uH) for energy storage.\nFeedback: R4/R5 divider sets output to 3.3V.\nInput caps: C5-C8. Output caps: C9-C11."
