	(text "TI TPS3422 precision voltage supervisor (U2).\nMonitors V3V3 rail for undervoltage/brownout.\nAsserts nRESET to MCU if V3V3 drops below threshold.\nEnsures clean power-on reset sequence.\nMAX803 (U5) provides additional reset supervision.\nR9/R11/R12: threshold and timing resistors."
