	(text "Two-button power management system:\nSW1 (Push): Graceful shutdown button.\n  Q1-Q2 N-FET inverter converts press to falling edge on PWR_BTN.\n  MCU detects IRQ_FALLING, syncs filesystem, then releases PWR_EN.\nSW2 (SPDT): Emergency hard-kill switch.\n  Directly controls PWR_EN via Q3-Q6 MOSFET logic.\n  Use only when MCU is unresponsive.\nQ1-Q6: MOSFET power switching (DMG1012T / NTR4101PT1G).\nD3-D7: Protection diodes (RB520S30)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
